<Slide style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px', backgroundColor: '#FAFCFE',
    padding: 0, position: 'relative', overflow: 'hidden',
}}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 64, top: 40, width: '1152px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16232E' }}>单元 1–3 · 先把地基拍实</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#5A6B7A', marginTop: 6 }}>
            三章都简单，但养成的是「写代码的手感」：命名、缩进、逐步验证
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{
        position: 'absolute', left: 64, top: 150, width: '1152px', height: 400,
        flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16,
    }}>
        <Box style={{
            flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D8E3EE', borderRadius: 12,
            padding: 22, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14,
        }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 46, height: 46, borderRadius: 8, background: '#1F5FA8', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>1</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16232E' }}>变量与简单数据类型</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8A9AAA' }}>教材第 1–2 章 · W1</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#3A4A58', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
                    变量命名规范、字符串全套操作、f-string 格式化、int / float 与注释。
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#3A4A58', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
                    必须讲透的点：浮点不能直接比较相等（0.1+0.2 ≠ 0.3）。
                    这是后面数据处理第一个坑。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{
                background: '#EEF5FB', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 14px',
                marginTop: 'auto', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3,
            }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8A9AAA' }}>动手项目</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1F5FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>个人偏好调查 2-1</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{
            flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D8E3EE', borderRadius: 12,
            padding: 22, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14,
        }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 46, height: 46, borderRadius: 8, background: '#1F5FA8', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>2</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16232E' }}>列表简介</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8A9AAA' }}>教材第 3 章 · W2</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#3A4A58', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
                    增删改查、索引从 0 开始、sort / sorted / reverse / len 的区别。
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#3A4A58', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
                    必须讲透的点：sorted() 返回新列表，.sort() 原地排序返回 None。
                    这是新手最高频的 bug。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{
                background: '#EEF5FB', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 14px',
                marginTop: 'auto', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3,
            }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8A9AAA' }}>练习</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1F5FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>对同一个列表做 20 次操作</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{
            flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #F0D9B0', borderLeft: '4px solid #E08A15', borderRadius: 12,
            padding: 22, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14,
        }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 46, height: 46, borderRadius: 8, background: '#E08A15', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>3</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16232E' }}>操作列表</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#B07A10' }}>教材第 4 章 · W3 · 难点</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#3A4A58', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
                    for 循环、range()、列表推导式、切片、元组、PEP 8 缩进规范。
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#3A4A58', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
                    必须讲透的点：赋值是同一对象的别名，切片才是复制。
                    90% 的「我明明复制了怎么变了」都出在这里。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{
                background: '#FDF3E2', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 14px',
                marginTop: 'auto', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3,
            }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#B07A10' }}>动手项目</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8A5A08', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>忘记密码清单 3.4–3.8</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{
        position: 'absolute', left: 64, top: 578, width: '1152px', height: 82,
        background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D8E3EE', borderRadius: 12,
        flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 26px', gap: 20,
    }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F5FA8' }}>验收标准</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#3A4A58', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
            能不查资料写出 for 循环完整结构 · 能解释切片第 2、3 个参数的含义 · 能区分 sorted 与 .sort · 能说清列表赋值与切片复制的区别
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{
        position: 'absolute', left: 64, bottom: 24, width: '1152px',
        flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center',
    }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A9AAA' }}>Python 阶段 0–2 课程大纲</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A9AAA' }}>06 / 23</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>